2026-07-27T10:12:23.7551178Z i /tmp/RtmpsHVQof/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7551599Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7552066Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7552490Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7553134Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7554085Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:12:23.7555132Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
